#: core/templates/core/patterns.html:52
msgid ""
"Each colour has one job. Ink is for actions: primary buttons and the current "
"tab. Links are blue and underlined. The brand blue is only for the logo, "
"focus rings and selection. Status colours are only for the verdict and run "
"state, always with an icon and a label. The theme hues mark data: Heat, "
"Cold, Rain and Drought, and a neutral for \"Also measured\". The trend scale "
"colours a significant decrease or increase, and the coverage steps a year's "
"missing days. Every text and background pair meets WCAG AA in both themes, "
"and the theme hues and chart colours stay apart for colour-blind readers "
"(both checked by tests from the token values). Charts outside the browser "
"read <code>chart-palette.json</code>."
